WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:00.843
(audience cheers)

00:00:00.843 --> 00:00:01.676
- Oh my God, this-

00:00:01.676 --> 00:00:03.020
- I feel like especially you ladies,

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.140
it's like y'all are like a girl group,

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.270
like with the tones happening right now.

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:07.830
- Thought we'd come here
to announce our girl group.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:08.690
- [Kelly Clarkson] Exactly.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.250
That's what we're doing today.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.150
Have you met everyone?

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.610
- I haven't.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:13.749
No, it's so nice to meet you.

00:00:13.749 --> 00:00:15.590
I can't even believe I'm
sitting next to them.

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.423
- Do you watch Bridgerton?

00:00:16.423 --> 00:00:17.573
- Are you kidding me?

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.050
Edwina? Penelope?

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.050
I'm like-

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:21.883
- [Kelly Clarkson] I know, I love it.

00:00:21.883 --> 00:00:22.716
I love them.

00:00:22.716 --> 00:00:24.060
- Me too, me too.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:24.893
I have to ask though,

00:00:24.893 --> 00:00:26.520
this is such a cool film,
Father of the Bride.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:27.400
So this is the remake.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.220
So had you seen the originals?

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:31.580
- Yes, yes, I watched-

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:32.810
- I only knew of the one original.

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:34.980
I didn't know there was
an Elizabeth Taylor one.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.130
I only knew the Steve Martin one.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:38.120
- [Adria Arjona] So
there's Elizabeth Taylor

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.860
and then the Martin Short, yeah.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:41.770
- [Kelly Clarkson] I was behind the-

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.603
Yeah.

00:00:42.603 --> 00:00:43.436
- [Adria Arjona] Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:43.436 --> 00:00:44.280
So I watched them,

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:48.210
but I think take on it is so different.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:51.500
It's still very similar, the format,

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.190
and I think the story is so universal.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:55.010
I mean, we all have family members

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.570
that are way too opinionated

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.550
and really get into our business.

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.160
- I love that your father
literally just said,

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:00.993
can you do that?

00:01:00.993 --> 00:01:01.826
- [Adria Arjona] Can you do that? Yeah.

00:01:01.826 --> 00:01:03.057
- Can you? Can you?

00:01:03.057 --> 00:01:03.890
- Can you do that? Yeah.

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:05.870
= Do you feel like it was represented,

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:06.703
the Latin community?

00:01:06.703 --> 00:01:08.260
Do you feel like it was represented right?

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:10.730
- 100%, and the beautiful thing,

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:12.820
and I think what I love
the most about this movie

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:14.740
is we're showing, you know,

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:17.090
there's a Mexican family,
there's a Cuban family,

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:19.370
and you'll see them sort of come together,

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:20.660
have their differences,

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:23.610
but at the end of the
day, we're all the same.

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:24.960
Maybe we eat different foods

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:27.410
and maybe we dance to different rhythms,

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:29.380
but at the end we're all human

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:31.320
and we're all going through

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:32.850
pretty much the same exact things.

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:34.433
(audience applauds)

00:01:34.433 --> 00:01:36.810
- Yeah, like ups and
downs, and love and loss,

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:37.643
all of that.

00:01:37.643 --> 00:01:41.980
- So you'll see very much both sides.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.610
The parents are getting a divorce,

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:44.750
so there's a conflict there,

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.280
and what I love-

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:47.113
- [Kelly Clarkson] That's fun.

00:01:47.113 --> 00:01:50.295
- I know, especially when
you're trying to get married.

00:01:50.295 --> 00:01:51.820
(Kelly Clarkson laughs)

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.200
- They're both probably
like, are you sure?

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.720
- [Adria Arjona] Sure about this?

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.010
So it's a really fun movie.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:59.140
- The cast is amazing.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:00.160
- Cast is amazing.

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:02.130
Andy Garcia and Gloria Estefan, what?

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:04.790
- [Kelly Clarkson] I
know. Estefan, I know.

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:06.760
I love her reaction in it.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:07.610
She was like, oh!

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:10.250
- I still can't believe it.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:11.083
I was so-

00:02:11.083 --> 00:02:12.350
When we were prepping this movie,

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:15.472
Andy loves the FaceTime, so
he would just FaceTime me,

00:02:15.472 --> 00:02:16.305
(Kelly Clarkson laughs)

00:02:16.305 --> 00:02:18.310
and wherever I was, I
made sure to tell people.

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.143
- [Kelly Clarkson] That's amazing.

00:02:19.143 --> 00:02:19.976
- I was like, excuse me, I gotta go.

00:02:19.976 --> 00:02:20.935
Andy Garcia's FaceTiming me.

00:02:20.935 --> 00:02:21.806
(group laughs)

00:02:21.806 --> 00:02:22.639
Just one second.

00:02:22.639 --> 00:02:24.626
Oh, sorry guys, it's Gloria Estefan.

00:02:24.626 --> 00:02:25.459
One second.

00:02:25.459 --> 00:02:26.292
(audience cheers lightly)

00:02:26.292 --> 00:02:27.125
- [Kelly Clarkson] Gimme a minute.

00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:27.958
- Just give me a minute.

00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:29.340
- To pick up that name.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:30.173
I love it.

00:02:30.173 --> 00:02:31.390
- Pick up that name.

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:33.240
- Okay, so it's time for another break.

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:34.870
The newest version of Father of the Bride

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:37.087
premieres June 16th on HBO Max.

